OL,3,GNEWSACancelled GWR trains 'least bad
OL,4,Achoice'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trains, previously been used by
OL,7,FTransport for Wales, were in storage
OL,8,Ffor two years before GWR started using
OL,9,Fthem in May.
OL,11,FTimetable changes were scheduled to run
OL,12,Funtil 11 December, but GWR said it
OL,13,Fhoped to bring the trains back before
OL,14,Fthat if possible.
